  "title": "Bits of Gold Transaction Issues",
  "description": "Why Was My Bits of Gold Transaction Declined?\nIf your transaction with Bits of Gold was declined, it’s likely due to payment issues, incom...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My Bits of Gold Transaction Declined?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your transaction with Bits of Gold was declined, it’s likely due to payment issues, incomplete verification, or bank-related restrictions. Here's a quick breakdown of what might’ve gone wrong and how to resolve it:</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Payment Issues:</b> Insufficient funds, incorrect payment details, or unsupported payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> ID, documents, or account not fully verified</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Bank Restrictions:</b> Some banks block or delay crypto-related transfers</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Review:</b> Transactions flagged as suspicious may be auto-declined</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction Limits:</b> You may have exceeded your buy/sell limits</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Ensure your payment info and funds are accurate and sufficient</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete all KYC/verification steps required by Bits of Gold</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank to confirm support for crypto transactions</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check your email (and spam) for messages from Bits of Gold</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry the transaction if the issue seems temporary</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://help.bitsofgold.co.il/en/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Bits of Gold Support</b></a><b>: </b><a href=\"https://help.bitsofgold.co.il/en/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>https://help.bitsofgold.co.il/en/</b></a></p></li></ol>",
